00:23:49.860 --> 00:23:51.840
um so yeah just like pulling back out

00:23:51.840 --> 00:23:55.260
from a high level view uh there&#x27;s like a

00:23:55.260 --> 00:23:57.539
clear issue uh in today&#x27;s scientific

