00:24:43.020 --> 00:24:46.500
so I&#x27;m going to follow his advice and

00:24:46.500 --> 00:24:48.360
look at an overview of the academic

00:24:48.360 --> 00:24:50.460
economy kind of like how I think of the

00:24:50.460 --> 00:24:52.200
three major players here and what their

00:24:52.200 --> 00:24:54.360
incentives are uh the first is Grant

00:24:54.360 --> 00:24:57.120
givers who have money and what they want

00:24:57.120 --> 00:24:59.460
is new knowledge so I like to think of

00:24:59.460 --> 00:25:01.740
this as like the example Susan G Komen

00:25:01.740 --> 00:25:04.020
which is a breast cancer non-profit they

00:25:04.020 --> 00:25:05.460
collect donations

00:25:05.460 --> 00:25:06.539
um from people who care about breast

00:25:06.539 --> 00:25:08.460
cancer and they distribute those

00:25:08.460 --> 00:25:10.260
