00:25:14.280 --> 00:25:15.840
cancer

00:25:15.840 --> 00:25:18.059
and then we have scientists who are

00:25:18.059 --> 00:25:19.980
actually doing the research

00:25:19.980 --> 00:25:21.840
um they have the ability to convert

00:25:21.840 --> 00:25:24.779
money into new knowledge and what they

00:25:24.779 --> 00:25:27.120
