00:25:40.020 --> 00:25:41.940
Publishers are kind of the third entity

00:25:41.940 --> 00:25:44.460
they have distribution and what they

00:25:44.460 --> 00:25:46.380
want generally although this is kind of

00:25:46.380 --> 00:25:48.360
